                <pb facs="0242" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg142"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/23598: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Mazatlan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Chapman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-04-21T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 21,
                                1920—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your April 16, 3 P.M.</p>
                <p>I have suggested to Navy Department that it send war vessel to Mazatlán and
                    Topolobampo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
